 200.4,8.5 195.2,9 190.1,8.8 185.3,8.4 180.1,8.8 174.8,8.8 170,8.1 165,8.2 159.7,8.4 154.8,7.8 150,7.6 144.8,8 139.7,7.9 134.9,7.5 129.7,7.8 124.4,7.8 119.6,7 114.7,7 109.5,7.3 104.5,7 99.6,7 94.4,7.3 89.3,7.1 84.5,6.7 79.4,7 74.2,7.3 69.3,6.9 64.3,6.9 59.1,7.2 54.2,7 49.3,7.1 44,7.6 38.9,7.4 34.1,7.1 29,7.6 23.8,7.7 19,7.4 14,7.8 8.7,8.2 3.8,7.8 1.4,7.3 1.1,7.1 .8,6.9 .6,6.6 .4,6.3 .3,6 .4,5.6 .5,5.2 .7,4.9 1,4.7 1.3,4.5 1.6,4.4 1.9,4.4 2.1,4.4Z"/></svg><p class="look-lede">Use a passkey from this device, your phone or a security key. No username is asked for.</p><div class="look-stack"><button type="button" data-passkey="login">Sign in with a passkey</button><p data-passkey-status="" role="status"></p></div><noscript><p>Passkeys need JavaScript. Without it, use the sign-in link in your email, or `ink login` from a terminal.</p></noscript><h2>Or get a link by email</h2><p>The link signs you in once, from this browser. The page answers the same whether or not the address has an account.</p><form method="post" action="/signin" aria-label="Email me a sign-in link"><div class="look-stack"><label>Email address <input type="email" name="address" autocomplete="email" required></label><button class="look-main" type="submit">Email me a link</button></div></form><script src="/passkey.js"></script></main></div></body></html>
